Cargo ltd. You may reply to this message and it will reach the office.\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026', 'trips', 'TRP-2026-0003', 'skipped', NULL, 'Demo scenario (Kigali Hardware): recorded for show, never sent.', 3, NULL, '2026-10-01 16:52:11');
