 correspondence about this load.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5b6670\">Thank you for your business.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 26px;background:#f7f9fb;border-top:1px solid #e9edf1\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a949e\">Sent by ITEC Cargo ltd. You may reply to this message and it will reach us.</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#9aa4ad\">Powered by ITEC LTD &copy; 2026</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>', 'Your goods are on the way to ITEC Kigali Main Warehouse\n\nDear Jean Claude Mugabo,\n\nWe are writing to confirm that your consignment left Dar es Salaam Port today and is now in transit to ITEC Kigali Main Warehouse. The details are set out below for your records.\n\nYOUR CONSIGNMENT\n  Detail: Consignment number  |  Value: SHP-2026-0003\n  Detail: Goods  |  Value: Floor tiles, taps, PVC pipes (building materials)\n  Detail: Weight  |  Value: 22,000 kg\n  Detail: Packages  |  Value: 640\n  Detail: Collected from  |  Value: Dar es Salaam Port\n  Detail: Delivering to  |  Value: ITEC Kigali Main Warehouse\n\nCARRIAGE\n  Detail: Vehicle  |  Value: RAD 482 K\n  Detail: Driver  |  Value: Samuel Niyonzima\n  Detail: Expected to arrive  |  Value: Tuesday 6 October 2026, 16:00\n\n\nWe will write to you again the moment your goods reach ITEC Kigali Main Warehouse, so that you can arrange collection. Please do not travel to the depot before that message.\n\nPlease quote consignment number SHP-2026-0003 in any correspondence about this load.\n\nThank you for your business.\n\nSent by ITEC Cargo ltd. You may reply to this message and it will reach us.\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026', 'shipments', 'SHP-2026-0003', 'skipped', NULL, 'Demo scenario (Kigali Hardware): recorded for show, never sent.', 3, NULL, '2026-10-01 16:52:11');
