 Detail: This payment  |  Amount: USD 1,888.00\n  Still outstanding: USD 1,888.00\n\nReceipt number: PAY-2026-0003\nInvoice number: INV-2026-0003\nDate received: 2026-10-01\nPaid by: Bank transfer\nYour reference: BK-KH-ADV-20261001\n\nUSD 1,888.00 remains outstanding on this invoice. Please quote the invoice number on your next payment.\n\nIf any detail above is not as you expected, reply to this message and we will check it.\n\nThis message was sent by the LMS logistics system on behalf of the company named above. Please do not reply to it directly.\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026', 'payments', 'PAY-2026-0003', 'skipped', NULL, 'Demo scenario (Kigali Hardware): recorded for show, never sent.', 3, NULL, '2026-10-01 16:52:11');
