ence</td><td style=\"padding:7px 0;font-size:14px;color:#22303c;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-weight:600\">DEL-2026-0003</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 12px 7px 0;font-size:13px;color:#77828d;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;white-space:nowrap\">Area</td><td style=\"padding:7px 0;font-size:14px;color:#22303c;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-weight:600\">Deliveries</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:24px 0 8px\"><a href=\"http://localhost/logistics-mvc/deliveries\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:11px 22px;background:#AD7D00;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Open it in LMS</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a949e\">If the button does not work, open this address:<br><span style=\"color:#5b6670;word-break:break-all\">http://localhost/logistics-mvc/deliveries</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 26px;background:#f7f9fb;border-top:1px solid #e9edf1\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a949e\">This message was sent by the LMS logistics system on behalf of the company named above. Please do not reply to it directly.</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#9aa4ad\">Powered by ITEC LTD &copy; 2026</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>', 'Load at its destination warehouse\n\nDEL-2026-0003 is off the truck at ITEC Kigali Main Warehouse and is waiting to be collected by Kigali Hardware Ltd (Jean Claude Mugabo).\n\nReference: DEL-2026-0003\nArea: Deliveries\n\nOpen it in LMS: http://localhost/logistics-mvc/deliveries\n\nThis message was sent by the LMS logistics system on behalf of the company named above. Please do not reply to it directly.\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026', 'deliveries', 'DEL-2026-0003', 'skipped', NULL, 'Demo scenario (Kigali Hardware): recorded for show, never sent.', 3, NULL, '2026-10-01 16:52:11');
