ackground:#f7f9fb;border-top:1px solid #e9edf1\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a949e\">Sent by ITEC Cargo ltd. You may reply to this message and it will reach us.</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#9aa4ad\">Powered by ITEC LTD &copy; 2026</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>', 'Goods handed over\n\nDear Jean Claude Mugabo,\n\nThis confirms that the goods below have been handed over. Thank you for your business.\n\nHANDED OVER\n  Detail: Reference  |  Value: DEL-2026-0003\n  Detail: Goods  |  Value: Floor tiles, taps, PVC pipes (building materials)\n  Detail: Received by  |  Value: Jean Claude Mugabo\n  Detail: On  |  Value: 2026-10-01 16:52:11\n\nProof of delivery: Held on file\n\nOur invoice for this consignment follows separately.\n\nSent by ITEC Cargo ltd. You may reply to this message and it will reach us.\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026', 'deliveries', 'DEL-2026-0003', 'skipped', NULL, 'Demo scenario (Kigali Hardware): recorded for show, never sent.', 3, NULL, '2026-10-01 16:52:11');
