r-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">TRP-2026-0002</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">Virunga Cement Distributors Ltd</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">Goma, DR Congo</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">In Transit</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">2,250</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">468,000</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">60</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">468,060</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">-465,810</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9edf1;font-size:14px;color:#22303c\">-20,702.7%</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:24px 0 8px\"><a href=\"http://localhost/logistics-mvc/reports/view/trip_profitability?from=2026-09-24&amp;to=2026-09-30\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:11px 22px;background:#AD7D00;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Open the full report</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a949e\">If the button does not work, open this address:<br><span style=\"color:#5b6670;word-break:break-all\">http://localhost/logistics-mvc/reports/view/trip_profitability?from=2026-09-24&amp;to=2026-09-30</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 26px;background:#f7f9fb;border-top:1px solid #e9edf1\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a949e\">This message was sent by the LMS logistics system on behalf of the company named above. Please do not reply to it directly.</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#9aa4ad\">Powered by ITEC LTD &copy; 2026</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>', 'Trip profitability\n\nYour weekly report for 24 Sep 2026 to 30 Sep 2026.\n\nInvoiced revenue, net of VAT, against trip cost (expenses plus fuel) for each trip, and the resulting margin.\n\nITEMS\n  Trip: TRP-2026-0002  |  Customer: Virunga Cement Distributors Ltd  |  To: Goma, DR Congo  |  Status: In Transit  |  Revenue: 2,250  |  Fuel: 468,000  |  Other cost: 60  |  Total cost: 468,060  |  Margin: -465,810  |  Margin: -20,702.7%\n\n\nOpen the full report: http://localhost/logistics-mvc/reports/view/trip_profitability?from=2026-09-24&to=2026-09-30\n\nThis message was sent by the LMS logistics system on behalf of the company named above. Please do not reply to it directly.\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026', 'report_emails', '1', 'skipped', NULL, 'Demo scenario (Kigali Hardware): recorded for show, never sent.', 3, NULL, '2026-10-01 16:52:12');
